<sect2 id="gimp-colors-components-menu">
  <title>O submenu <quote>Componentes</quote></title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Cores</primary>
    <secondary>Componentes</secondary>
  </indexterm>

  <para>O submenu <guimenuitem>Componentes</guimenuitem> contém operações que trabalham em componentes de cor individuais ou onde você pode combinar ou separar estes componentes.</para>

  <para>
    <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <xref linkend="gimp-filter-channel-mixer"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <xref linkend="gimp-filter-component-extract"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <xref linkend="gimp-filter-mono-mixer"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <xref linkend="plug-in-compose"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <xref linkend="plug-in-decompose"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          <xref linkend="plug-in-recompose"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>
  </para>

  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o submenu</title>
    <para>
      You can access this submenu from the main menu through
      <menuchoice>
        <guimenu>Colors</guimenu>
        <guimenuitem>Components</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
